      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCRUB'S BLUE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Cambla Diva (21.86) in a OPEN. Has the pace to be prominent. Can go on with it. HARA'S JACKSON (7) missed the frame last time but prior to that was an effortless Grade 5 winner (21.89) at this track, scoring by 5 lengths. Has the ability and expected to do much better. HOPE'S JACKY (4) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and two placings from 13 starts. Was out of the placings last time (22.19) at this track in a OPEN, finishing sixth and beaten 4 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. GOLDSTAR SUMMER (2) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts ago but finished sixth last time (20.15) at this track. Goes very well from this draw with five wins and two minor placings from 12 starts.",
